# Class: obo:FOODON_00001202 (winged bean food product)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00001202 "A bean food product which derives from a winged bean plant (Psophocarpus tetragonolobus)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_00001202 "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winged_bean")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:FOODON_00001202 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00001202 "winged bean food product"@en)
