AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_02000294 "Porterhouse Chops are named after English pubs that served \"Porter\" ale. Porterhouse Chops include the larger wider portion of the Tenderloin from the posterior Lumbar region of the Loin."@en)
